Patch 0003 (fid-num-transcendentals) of fid-clarabel, spec node KRN.SOLV.CONIC.PATCH.

Route sqrt, ln, min and max through fid_num::f (sqrt, ln, total_min, total_max) via algebra/knp.rs, replace powi by explicit products, stop on a non-finite mu with NumericalError, validate input data (CSC format, no NaN, no -infinity in b, checked cone sizes) at solver setup and finite values in data updates, never report a solved, almost solved or infeasible status without finite values of record (info reset to NaN, previous iterate restored on a non-finite mu, solution status demoted), convert upstream panics (panic!, unwrap, unreachable!, the CscMatrix entry-point asserts) to errors or statuses, and document the invariant of each remaining internal assert.

Rule IDs and rationale: vendor/fid-clarabel/AUDIT.toml.

